{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["reflection:read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Read the check history"},"description":"List the longitudinal audit of actions checked by an AI agent and their verdicts for the connected user. Use id to read the check named by a journal entry's agent_reflection_id. Follow both returned cursor values when paging. Checks made in Investboard itself are not listed. Outcomes are investor-reported and never establish execution. Saved verdicts retain their original evidence dates. Each record carries linked_decision, a reading derived from the investor's own trades on the way out and never stored: it names the day an execution landed and how surely it was matched, never an instrument and never a value.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"before":{"format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\d|2[0-8])))T(?:(?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d:[0-5]\\d(?:\\.\\d+)?(?:Z|([+-](?:[01]\\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\\d)))$","type":"string"},"before_id":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"id":{"description":"A check id, e.g. a journal entry's agent_reflection_id.","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"limit":{"maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_reflection_history","outputSchema":{"$